      "text": "• WiFi and Bluetooth\n• On/off switch + mode switch\n• Two-pin motor breakout\n• PWM vibration control\n• Lithium charging circuit\n• Lithium discharge protection\n• Internal battery connector\n• Wired tip temperature sensor\n• Accelerometer\n• Two magnetic charging contacts",
