      "text": "Define “light use” before choosing capacity:\n• Motor runtime + PWM / mode distribution\n• WiFi / Bluetooth active, idle and sleep time\n• Sensor sampling + usable battery capacity",
      "originalText": "Define “light use” before choosing capacity:\n• Motor runtime + PWM / mode distribution\n• WiFi / Bluetooth active, idle and sleep time\n• Sensor sampling + usable battery capacity",
