      "updated": 1791904230526,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1  Motor: NFP-E1015 vs “N20 bullet”?\n2  Battery chemistry, capacity and dimensions?\n3  Charging supply + contact / magnet geometry?\n4  T-handle PCB outline + component locations?\n5  What do modes and wireless control do?\n6  Tip sensor type, range and thermal response?\n7  Accelerometer purpose + sampling needs?\n8  Motor behavior during charging / faults?",
      "originalText": "1  Motor: NFP-E1015 vs “N20 bullet”?\n2  Battery chemistry, capacity and dimensions?\n3  Charging supply + contact / magnet geometry?\n4  T-handle PCB outline + component locations?\n5  What do modes and wireless control do?\n6  Tip sensor type, range and thermal response?\n7  Accelerometer purpose + sampling needs?\n8  Motor behavior during charging / faults?",
