      "text": "• PWM motor driver + two-pin motor output\n• On/off and mode switches\n• Battery discharge protection + battery choice\n• 3.3 V supply path + MCU power / enable wiring\n• Sensor-to-MCU connections + pin assignment\n• Magnetic charging contacts / connector\n• RF matching values + completed antenna path",
